criteria.text:
Owner standards hold for every tool, and a tool-contract test checks them mechanically:
- the description names its linked objects, enums and skills;
- the schema has no ambiguous args;
- validation errors list accepted args and enum values;
- outputs stay under a byte cap or page;
- describe explains every linked object;
- create/update calls are idempotent where possible.

artifact_read returns an image in 1 call, and the architect can reap a seat it spawned with a custom participant_id.
